      "statement": "Profile lookup resolves a spec by exact match first, then provider prefix, then None; when both an exact-model and a provider-level profile exist they are merged with the exact-model entry overriding, and malformed specs (empty, multiple colons, or an empty half) return None without consulting the registry.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://libs/deepagents/deepagents/profiles/harness/harness_profiles.py#L1050-L1103",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8aa31319cded98b47a06b1b80f96bf952d611789046a1bc05d53aa098d8c23e0:"
